<title>AUSTRALIA: Moody's affirms RAMS Series 2 bonds at Aaa.</title>
<headline>Moody's affirms RAMS Series 2 bonds at Aaa.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said it has confirmed the Aaa rating assigned to the Series 2 Class A bonds issued by RAMS Mortgage Corporation Ltd following the issuance of an additional A$190 million in the series.</p>
<p>With this additional issuance, the total amount of Series 2 Class A bonds increased to A$950 million.</p>
<p>--Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
